  "body": "## What changed\nThe Machines pane kind dropdown (`machines-new-kind`) gains an \"All\" entry, selected by default. Under \"All\" every machine is listed and **New blank** is disabled (\"Pick a kind first\"). Picking a kind filters the list to that kind (machines with no stated kind show only under \"All\") and enables New blank, accent-filled. `MachinesPane::new_kind` became `kind_filter: Option<usize>` (ephemeral view state, no command). A selection hidden by the filter is cleared; the count label reads \"k of N machines\" while filtered. Decisions: `docs/decisions/816-kind-filter.md`.\n\n## How tested\n- Pinning: `egui_app::tests::machines_edit::the_kind_dropdown_filters_the_list_and_gates_new_blank` (All = every row + New blank disabled; lathe = only lathe rows + enabled; back to All restores). Driven through the real dropdown.\n- `a_backwards_travel_is_refused_on_its_field_and_nothing_is_written` now picks a kind before New blank.\n- Quick gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`) green (ui lib 455 passed); clippy `-D warnings` clean on camcraft-ui.\n\n## Not exercised\nBatch/release tiers, snapshot lane (no PNG changed), hand-testing the GUI.\n\nChangelog: Machines pane: the kind dropdown has an All entry and filters the machine list; New blank needs a kind (#816, PR #834)\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #816\n\n",
